{"id":"489531","name":"胡萝卜西洋菜排骨汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/489531/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西洋菜","amount":"3小把"},{"name":"排骨","amount":"250g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"南杏","amount":"5g"},{"name":"北杏","amount":"5g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"西洋菜洗净。(我这西洋菜按把卖，都是嫩尖。)","img":"images/489531/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮剁块。","img":"images/489531/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"南北杏洗干净。","img":"images/489531/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"排骨飞水，洗去浮沫。","img":"images/489531/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把排骨，胡萝卜，南北杏放入汤锅，放入8杯水大火烧开，转中小火煲30-40分钟。","img":"images/489531/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煲了40分钟的汤。","img":"images/489531/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入西洋菜大火转10分钟。","img":"images/489531/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放盐调味即可。","img":"images/489531/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"入秋清润的时令汤水。","img":"images/489531/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}